Three-stage sequential design on same olivine location:
(1) Pre-ablation pass (2 J cm⁻², 150 µm square, 300 µm s⁻¹) to remove surface contamination;
(2) Run 1 — major elements (30 µm circular, MR M/ΔM=4000, 20 Hz, 7 nuclides);
(3) Run 2 — trace elements (130 µm circular, LR M/ΔM=300, 40 Hz, 36 nuclides; Cr from run 1 as IS)

